<title>USA: Nevada Power Co hits system peak.</title>
<headline>Nevada Power Co hits system peak.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nevada Power Co Thursday said it set a new record system peak of 3,424 megawatts on Wednesday, August 6, at 5 p.m.</p>
<p>Last year's record system peak occurred Tuesday, July 23 at with a recording of 3,332 megawatts.</p>
<p>Nevada Power Company provides electricity and energy services to more than 1.2 million residents in Las Vegas and Southern Nevada and is the nation's fastest growing electric utility.</p>
